  "prefLabel": "Hab 102.10 Ex parte communication",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 102.10 “Ex parte communication” means any direct or indirect communication with the board or an board member concerning a pending matter when all parties to the proceeding are not present or when all parties have not been sent a copy of any written communication in accordance with RSA 541-A:36.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
